# OSC 7: the path a pane keeps after it reported file:///tmp/osc7-base and then printed the case's bytes.
# payload: the bytes in hex ({host}: the machine's name; {hh*N}: byte hh N times). tmux: `#{pane_path}`, tmux 3.4
# measured, in hex. warren: the stored path in hex, the pane named {host}. kept: the earlier path; none: no path.
# A row whose columns differ names why: path-not-url (tmux keeps the URL as sent, warren its path, the URL
# decoded by warren's rule), refuses-malformed, other-host-ignored, over-long-dropped; every other row is equal.
